<Page title="Accessibility · SecureLab">
  <h1>Accessibility</h1>
  <p>
    Use Tab to move among controls, arrow keys to move among lab tabs, and
    Escape to close a dialog. Ctrl or Command plus Enter runs tests from the Fix
    panel. Results use labels alongside color.
  </p><p>
    <a href="https://git.akibh.dev/akib/secureLab/issues"
      >Report an accessibility problem</a
    > with the page, browser and steps that led to it.
  </p>
</Page>
